===Etymology===
Substantive use of {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{term|grenate|lang=fro}} in {{term|pomme grenate||pomegranate|lang=fro}}, from dialectal {{etyl|it|fr}} {{term|pom granat|lang=it}}, from {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|pomum granatum||seeded fruit|lang=la}}, from {{m|la|grānātum}}. The ''-d-'' developed under influence from Spanish {{term|granada|lang=es}}.

===Pronunciation===
